       *> CONSTRAI - record layout of Constraints (generated by rulebook-to-cobol).
       *> Use: COPY CONSTRAI REPLACING ==:P:== BY ==<prefix>== under a level
       *> 01-10 group. Record length: 1105 bytes.
       *> A NULL field has <name>-NI = "Y"; text is <name>-LEN bytes of <name>;
       *> booleans are "Y"/"N"; numbers are packed decimal.
       *> Name (calculated, string)
           15 :P:-NAME-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-NAME-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-NAME PIC X(64).
       *> ConstraintKey (raw, string)
           15 :P:-CONSTRAINT-KEY-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-CONSTRAINT-KEY PIC X(64).
       *> Entity (raw, string)
           15 :P:-ENTITY-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-ENTITY PIC X(64).
       *> Predicate (raw, string)
           15 :P:-PREDICATE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-PREDICATE PIC X(64).
       *> Deontic (raw, string)
           15 :P:-DEONTIC-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-DEONTIC PIC X(64).
       *> Severity (raw, string)
           15 :P:-SEVERITY-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-SEVERITY PIC X(64).
       *> Message (raw, string)
           15 :P:-MESSAGE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-MESSAGE PIC X(248).
       *> RuleGroup (raw, string)
           15 :P:-RULE-GROUP-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-RULE-GROUP-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-RULE-GROUP PIC X(64).
       *> SourceCitation (raw, string)
           15 :P:-SOURCE-CITATION-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-SOURCE-CITATION-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-SOURCE-CITATION PIC X(98).
       *> RuleSpeakOverride (raw, string)
           15 :P:-RULE-SPEAK-OVERRIDE-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-RULE-SPEAK-OVERRIDE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-RULE-SPEAK-OVERRIDE PIC X(286).
       *> IsActive (raw, bool)
           15 :P:-IS-ACTIVE PIC X.
